%% title: How the school website goes live
%% desc: The Admin sets up a web address, a design and a logo. The website stays private until the Admin presses Publish. After publishing, anyone can read it without logging in. Notices and teacher cards the Admin chose to show appear on it. The Admin can turn it off and on again.
flowchart LR
  S["Admin sets up<br/>address · design · logo"]:::admin --> B["Admin presses Publish"]:::admin
  B --> W["Website is on<br/>anyone can read it"]
  N["Notices marked Show on the website<br/>teachers marked Show on the website"] --> W
  W --> O["Admin can turn it off<br/>and on again"]:::admin
  classDef admin fill:#fff4e6,stroke:#e8590c,color:#7a2e05
